{"id": "x000-033", "text": "Tariq loves F1, Ferrari fan. supports Arsenal too. going to Silverstone w/ his dad next July - his dad's 70th, the whole thing was Tariq's idea. he's been saving since Easter. said his dad still talks abt seeing Senna in 88, so maybe find an old programme or poster as a bday thing from me too", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tariq", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "F1", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Ferrari", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Arsenal", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going to Silverstone", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next July", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "70th", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tariq", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "since Easter"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i4", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Senna", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in 88"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "find an old programme or poster as a bday thing from me", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1"}]}
