{"id": "x000-049", "text": "Owen's review w/ Helen was yesterday. didn't get the raise, 2nd yr running, he's thinking abt leaving. already had a chat w/ a recruiter & has a 1st round somewhere on 4/12 - won't say where. his partner Sophie wants him to go for it, she's fed up of him moaning lol. coffee w/ him mon to talk it thru, & ask how the 4/12 one went after", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Owen", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "review", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Helen", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "thinking abt leaving", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "recruiter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "1st round", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "4/12", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sophie", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "fed up of him moaning", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "coffee w/ him", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "mon", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask how the 4/12 one went", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "4/12", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "after", "anchor": "a2"}]}
